              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="10" rx="2"></rect>
              <path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"></path>
            </svg>
            Secure checkout · Card &amp; USDT (BEP-20)
          </p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-center text-xs text-[var(--color-ink-dim]">Checkout is handled by Stripe.</p>
